      "key": {
        "uuid": "8482cb0a_aec52e19",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/Texture.h",
        "patchSetId": 11
      },
      "lineNbr": 310,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000014
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-09-11T00:00:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I requested it be in this order so it would match WGSL `value.r001.rgba` for example. Personally I think that makes it easier to understand instead of looking at it the other way like `swiz_rgba(swiz_r001(value))` or `(swiz_rgba ∘ swiz_r001)(value)`.\n\nRegardless we should have a comment at least that explains the order succinctly, it\u0027s hard to read the code to figure it out.",
      "parentUuid": "6eabe0ca_b5cf7525",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 309,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 310,
        "endChar": 53
