      "writtenOn": "2025-09-11T00:00:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit: The need for this helper could be eliminated by adding a [default comparison](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/default_comparisons.html) `bool operator\u003d\u003d(const TextureComponentSwizzle\u0026) const \u003d default;` to the definition in `webgpu_cpp.h`.",
